      ],
      "desc": "The photograph was taken in Bipenggou. A stranger asked me to take his picture as a keepsake. Fifteen years ago he had come here with friends; now they are married and busy with their own lives, and meeting again has become rare. In the falling snow, he said the memory felt like a lifetime ago. I did not photograph his face, only his silent back. Before time and snow, words are always superfluous."
