      "desc": "An old earthen house beneath a blossoming apricot tree. An old man walks slowly through the yard, head bowed; chickens and pigeons wander at ease. Rough, weathered walls, branches soft with flowers.\nA tree in bloom, a courtyard of everyday warmth, time moving gently. In this calm highland daily life lies the relaxed poetry of nature and human life together."
