      ],
      "desc": "I came to the Val Colla valley on a hike that took me across the Swiss border. As of 2025, many of the roads here still had no official names; people relied on village names, old place names, and their mutual familiarity to identify their homes. Since then, I have repeatedly visited the villages in the valley, getting to know the people who still live here, and gradually formed a connection with this border valley, whose population continues to decline and whose residents are gradually aging."
